( CHIP REVISION) Tj
T* (ESP32-P4NRW16/32 and ESP32-P4NRW16X/32X use) Tj
T* (different IC revisions and are not drop-in compatible.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Non-X version, chip revision v1.x: Pin 54 is NC and) Tj
T* (must be left unconnected.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (X version, chip revision v3.x: Pin 54 is VDD_HP and) Tj
T* (must be connected to the VDD_HP power rail.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (v1.x and v3.x require separate firmware builds and) Tj
T* (cannot use the same firmware image.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (ESP32-P4NRW16/32 is planned for EOL.) Tj
T* (ESP32-P4NRW16X/32X is recommended for new) Tj
T* (designs. But some Dev Board still use Non-X version) Tj
T* (chip) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Verify the exact chip part number and revision before) Tj
T* (PCB assembly. ) Tj
